# The picker draws the same glyph in the same colour Herdr's own spaces sidebar
# draws, resolved from the user's config rather than assumed. Everything below
# is a port of Herdr 0.8.2; each table cites the source it came from so a future
# upstream change can be diffed against it rather than guessed at.
