# as the 256-colour form "38;5;<index>" (ratatui-crossterm/src/lib.rs:421 into
# crossterm src/style/types/colored.rs:132) and an Rgb as "38;2;r;g;b". Emitting
# the identical escape means the terminal resolves it identically — which is the
# whole point under theme.name = "terminal", where indexes 0-15 follow the host
# terminal profile that Herdr is following too.

